## Cross-Platform Validation

### macOS (Intel & ARM)
```bash
# On macOS amd64
vscode-extension/bin/darwin/amd64/poml --help

# On macOS arm64 (M1/M2/M3)
vscode-extension/bin/darwin/arm64/poml --help

# Test extension locally
npm run esbuild && code . && F5
```

### Linux
```bash
# On Linux amd64
vscode-extension/bin/linux/amd64/poml --help

# On Linux arm64 (Raspberry Pi, etc.)
vscode-extension/bin/linux/arm64/poml --help
```

### Windows
```bash
# On Windows amd64
vscode-extension/bin/windows/amd64/poml.exe --help

# On Windows arm64
vscode-extension/bin/windows/arm64/poml.exe --help
```

