## Test Fixtures

### Mock POML Files

**test-fixture.simple.poml**
```xml
<poml>
  <meta>
    <id>test.simple</id>
    <version>0.1.0</version>
  </meta>
  <role>Test role</role>
  <task>Test task</task>
</poml>
```

**test-fixture.complex.poml**
```xml
<poml>
  <meta>
    <id>test.complex</id>
    <version>0.1.0</version>
  </meta>
  <role>Complex test</role>
  <task>Multiple features</task>
  <input>
    <doc>Test document</doc>
    <style>test-style</style>
  </input>
</poml>
```

### Test Data

- Temporary directories for file operations
- Mock servers for HTTP tests
- Sample API responses for fixtures

