## Running CI/CD Tests Locally

### Simulate GitHub Actions

```bash
# Install act (local GitHub Actions runner)
brew install act

# Run workflow locally
act -j test

# Run specific workflow
act -W .github/workflows/build-release.yml
```

### Manual CI Simulation

```bash
# Build
npm run esbuild

# Lint
npm run lint

# Test
npm test

# Coverage
npm test -- --coverage

# Package
npm run package
```

