## Debugging Tests

### Debug Single Test

```bash
# With node inspector
node --inspect-brk node_modules/.bin/jest manager.test.ts

# In VS Code:
# 1. Open .vscode/launch.json
# 2. Add debug configuration for Jest
# 3. Set breakpoints in test file
# 4. Press F5 to debug
```

### Verbose Output

```bash
npm test -- --verbose

# Shows:
# - Each test name
# - Pass/fail status
# - Execution time
# - Error stack traces
```

### Coverage Debug

```bash
npm test -- --coverage --verbose

# Shows detailed coverage info per file
```

